---
title: Voice call · backend setup, one private Daily room
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant tab as Session tab · Pipecat client
  participant api as FastAPI · Supabase Compute
  participant daily as Daily
  participant agent as Pipecat Cloud · voice agent

  tab->>api: open connection
  Note over api: Authorize the originating user.<br/>Rejoin the running call, or replace an ended one.<br/>Provider keys stay server-side.
  api->>daily: create room, or eject the stale tab
  daily-->>api: room URL + meeting tokens
  api->>agent: queue the voice agent Job + start the session
  Note over agent: Claims the interview.voice_agent Job.<br/>Flux · Sol Ultrafast · ElevenLabs
  api-->>tab: room URL + meeting token
  tab->>daily: join · WebRTC audio + RTVI events
  agent->>daily: join with the owner token
  Note over daily: One private room per connection.<br/>It expires and ejects everyone.
